To optimize the generated LLVM IR code, we will apply advanced transformations such as loop unrolling, function inlining, and interprocedural optimizations. We will also implement a just-in-time (JIT) compilation pipeline to dynamically compile optimized LLVM IR at runtime.
```rust
use llvm::{Module};

struct MyApp {
    // ...
