private:
    std::unordered_map<std::string, double> _tradeOffs; // Map of trade-off decisions and their associated costs and benefits
};
```
By following these best practices and implementing the above design patterns, we can create a high-performance, scalable, and reliable message passing library that is easy to use and maintain.']

