Note that this implementation assumes that the number of threads acquiring and releasing semaphores will be relatively small compared to the total number of threads in the system. If you expect a large number of threads to acquire and release semaphores frequently, you may want to consider using a more advanced synchronization mechanism such as a condition variable or a thread-safe queue.']

