The service also incorporates a centralized configuration management system to simplify the management of diverse external APIs. This ensures that any changes in external API versions, authentication mechanisms, or service level agreements (SLAs) can be easily handled without downtime. Furthermore, it supports secure and compliant data sharing agreements with partner organizations, adhering to all relevant legal and regulatory frameworks.

